; Non-bonded interaction parameters sourced from martini_v3.0.0.itp, restricted to the
; PE (C1) and cellulose (SN6, SP4r, SP1r, TC4) bead types used in the PE/cellulose
; interfacial simulations. All Lennard-Jones epsilon values involving at least one
; cellulose bead type (cellulose-cellulose and cellulose-PE pairs) have been scaled by
; 70% of their original martini_v3.0.0.itp value to reduce the overpredicted cellulose
; surface tension and melting temperature seen with the unmodified parameters. PE-PE
; (C1-C1) interactions are unchanged from martini_v3.0.0.itp.
;
; Please cite the following paper for the underlying Martini 3 forcefield:
;   Souza, P C T; Alessandri, R; Barnoud, J; Thallmair, S; Faustino, I; Grünewald, F; Patmanidis, I; Abdizadeh, H; Bruininks, B M H; Wassenaar, T A; Kroon, P C; Melcr, J; Nieto, V; Corradi, V; Khan, H M; Domański, J; Javanainen, M; Martinez-Seara, H; Reuter, N; Best, R B; Vattulainen, I; Monticelli, L; Periole, X; Tieleman, D P; de Vries, A H; Marrink, S J;  Nature Methods 2021; 10.1038/s41592-021-01098-3

[ defaults ]
; nbfunc comb-rule
1 2

[ atomtypes ]
; name bond_type mass charge ptype sigma
C1   72.0 0.0 A 0.0 0.0
SN6  54.0 0.0 A 0.0 0.0
SP4r 54.0 0.0 A 0.0 0.0
SP1r 54.0 0.0 A 0.0 0.0
TC4  36.0 0.0 A 0.0 0.0

[ nonbond_params ]
; atom1 atom2 func sigma epsilon
SN6  C1   1  0.43 1.512
SN6  SN6  1  0.41 2.149
SP4r SN6  1  0.41 1.988
SP1r SN6  1  0.41 2.149
SN6  TC4  1 0.366  1.12
TC4  C1   1 0.395 1.295
TC4  TC4  1  0.34 1.057
SP4r TC4  1 0.394 0.903
SP1r TC4  1 0.378 1.015
C1   C1   1  0.47  3.39
SP4r C1   1  0.43 1.211
SP1r C1   1  0.43 1.351
SP4r SP4r 1  0.41 2.317
SP1r SP1r 1  0.41 1.988
SP4r SP1r 1  0.41 1.988
